+# Nonselected repair proposal for `3f600d3093b8`
+
+This proposal addresses the two teaching holes in the retained audits without changing the selected production generator:
+
+- ordinary generation and `self_check` support one marked row or one marked column, including the stored canonical 1×3 extraction;
+- ordinary selected cells can contain color 8, with a constructive selected intersection whenever `include_eight=true`.
+
+It also replaces the inert public control surface with six exact controls, rejects unknown controls and nonexact types, supports the advertised 5–16 scale, and preserves deterministic keyed draws.
+
+Run from the packet root:
+
+```bash
+python3 review.py run python3 -m pytest \
+  generators/3f600d3093b8/workspace/repair_proposal/test_repair.py -q
+```
+
+The proposal is not production-approved. Owner integration should copy or adapt `generator.py`, run the task’s normal lint/authority checks, and retain the canonical one-row example as a regression.
